WEBVTT

00:11:56.420 --> 00:12:00.299
The statistician George Box famously said,

00:12:01.175 --> 00:12:04.720
"All models are wrong,
but some are useful."

00:12:05.471 --> 00:12:06.722
(Laughter)

00:12:07.556 --> 00:12:09.600
I do the work that I do

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:13.520
because the promise and hope
of brain assembloids and organoids

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:17.399
is that by allowing us
to recreate circuits of the human brain,

00:12:17.399 --> 00:12:21.069
we will gain new insights
into human biology.

00:12:21.069 --> 00:12:25.908
And this in itself will open a new era
in the treatment of brain disorders.

00:12:25.908 --> 00:12:27.159
Thank you.

00:12:27.201 --> 00:12:31.371
(Applause)